{
  "job_B3.3.17.2_20261117_184339": {
    "chunk_text": "an men swi\u00f0e \u00d0a wolde he Sanctus Martinus \u00e6lce \u00feinga \u00f0\u00e6t gyld abrecan & gefyllan. \u00d0a wi\u00f0stodan him \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00feenan men & hine mid teonan aweg adrifon. \u00dea eode he \u00f0\u00e6r rihte big on sume stowe, & hine \u00fea gegyrede mid h\u00e6renum hr\u00e6gle swi\u00fee heardum & \u00dea he hit for manna teonan gebrecan ne moste, \u00fea comon \u00fe\u00e6r semninga twegen englas to him & cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hie God sylf sende \u00fe\u00e6t hie sceoldan \u00fe\u00e6t h\u00e6\u00feene weorod geflyman, & Martine \u00d0a eodan hie eft to \u00f0\u00e6m tune, & \u00fe\u00e6t gild gebr\u00e6can & gefyldan eal o\u00fe grund. & \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan men tolocodan, ah hie hwe\u00fere w\u00e6ron mid godcundum m\u00e6gene to\u00f0\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gefyrhte, Ah hie ealle to Drihtnes geleafan gecirdon, & hie cw\u00e6dan to him \u00f0\u00e6t se an w\u00e6re so\u00f0 God se \u00fee Swylce eac gelamp sume si\u00f0e, \u00f0\u00e6r he sum gild br\u00e6c \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r gearn mycel menigeo to him \u00f0ara \u00d0a w\u00e6s heora sum re\u00f0ra & hatheortra \u00f0onne \u00fea o\u00fere; gebr\u00e6gd \u00f0a his sweorde, mynte hine slean. \u00dea he \u00fea Sanctus Martinus \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, \u00fea dyde he sona \u00fe\u00e6t hr\u00e6gl of his sweoran, & leat for\u00f0 to \u00f0\u00e6m \u00d0a he \u00fea se h\u00e6\u00feena man upr\u00e6hte mid \u00fe\u00e6re swi\u00feran handa, & hine slean mynte, \u00f0a feol he f\u00e6ringa Swylce w\u00e6",
